# The public half of the key that signs every release's SHASUMS256.txt.
#
# `uze` embeds this file when it is built, install.sh and install.ps1 carry
# the same line (a test holds the three equal), and `ssh-keygen -Y verify`
# checks the signature against it, under the namespace `uze-release`,
# before anything a release names is unpacked.
#
# PLACEHOLDER: no release key has been generated yet. Until the line below
# is one `ssh-ed25519 ...` public key, the release workflow refuses to
# publish and the updater and the installers refuse to install.
# See docs/versioning.md, "Signing", for how the key is made.
